        <mxCell id="p01-auto1" parent="p01-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F2D3D;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="01 · Context — EXE Team Matching System" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="1500" x="30" y="16" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p01-auto2" parent="p01-1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Source of truth: code under ExeMatchingProject/. Repository state: Phase 1 code-base skeleton (README §1). Infrastructure, schemas and seed data work; business endpoints are stubs." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="1560" x="30" y="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p01-purpose" parent="p01-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;arcSize=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;System purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coordinates Capstone/EXE course work at semester level: importing students, managing semesters, forming student teams (groups), electing a team leader by vote, randomly placing students without a team, requesting a mentor with limited quota, and notifying participants of events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Evidence: README.md §1; domain entities in *.Domain/Entities; controllers in *.Api/Controllers; Contracts/Events/DomainEvents.cs.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="470" x="30" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p01-scope" parent="p01-1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Delivery status (verified)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Implemented: Nginx gateway routing, PostgreSQL schema creation + seed (EF Core EnsureCreated), global exception middleware, Swagger UI, Docker Compose / Render blueprints.&lt;br&gt;• Skeleton: POST /api/auth/login returns a hard-coded token.&lt;br&gt;• Stub: every other REST endpoint throws NotImplementedException → HTTP 501.&lt;br&gt;• Mock: gRPC MentorGrpcService returns hard-coded data; EmailService only logs.&lt;br&gt;• Stub: Kafka publisher/consumer only log.&lt;br&gt;• Configured, unused: Redis; JwtBearer package (no auth middleware)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="290" width="470" x="30" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p01-bnd" parent="p01-1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingBottom=6;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=12;arcSize=2;fillColor=#F7FAFE;" value="System boundary — EXE Team Matching System" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="460" width="520" x="640" y="150" as="geometry" />
