        <mxCell id="p11-auto15" value="&lt;b&gt;Schema notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Source: EF Core conventions only (no Fluent config / data annotations) → all strings are &lt;code&gt;text&lt;/code&gt;, no max length.&lt;br&gt;• No UNIQUE on Users.Email, Students.StudentCode, Semesters.Code, Groups.GroupCode.&lt;br&gt;• Created by &lt;code&gt;Database.EnsureCreated()&lt;/code&gt; at API start-up; no migrations folder.&lt;br&gt;• Render blueprint points all 3 APIs at ONE database (exe_matching_db); EnsureCreated skips creation if any table exists → only the first service would get its tables (runtime Not verified)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p11-1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="830" width="800" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
